# EcoTrack

Prefer Next.js App Router, TypeScript, and small modules. Keep the MVP
runnable with `npm run dev`. Estimate carbon from natural language in
`lib/estimate.ts`. If parsing fails, show a clear message instead of a
fake number. No auth, no database, no speculative abstractions.
